abel":"Review item 6: label","kind":"short","required":true,"maxLength":300},{"key":"reviewRule5Message","label":"Review item 6: guidance when incomplete","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":4000},{"key":"reviewRule6Label","label":"Review item 7: label","kind":"short","required":true,"maxLength":300},{"key":"reviewRule6Message","label":"Review item 7: guidance when incomplete","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":4000}],"protectedFields":["id","launchType","stepKeys","artifactFieldIds","artifactFieldTypes","artifactFieldRequirements","rubricKeys","consultSupportType","hrWall","ciRequired"],"requiredReviewDimensions":["language_alignment","factual_currentness","accessibility","scope","placement"],"approvedValues":{"title":"Policy, form, or notice change","staffLabel":"I'm changing a form, notice, or policy","signals":["A staff- or public-facing form, letter, or notice","A policy or procedure text change","A process change people must follow"],"startingCompetence":"You are preparing a policy, form, notice, or letter and want to make sure it is clear, accessible, and workable for the people who will use it.","graduatedLooksLike":"By the end, you will have a clear record of the change, its effect on people, access needs, sources, follow-up responsibilities, and a review date. You can usually complete routine changes with these resources and seek human guidance for high-stakes questions or conflicting Official sources.","askStarters":["We are changing a renewal notice. What access and burden questions should we work through?","Where is the plain language checklist?","Two guidance documents disagree about a notice requirement. What should I do?"],"artifactTitle":"Change impact notes and access checklist","needsWork":["A general statement that equity was considered without any language, access, or process details","A statute cited from memory"],"readyToUse":["Specific notes about barriers and access","Sources are clearly labeled","Unanswered policy questions are taken to the policy owner"],"privacy":"No individual accommodation case details; general access needs only.","step0Title":"Consider access and impact","step0Guidance":"Use Ask to work through plain-language, access, and process questions. If you need a statute or rule, the answer will be clear about whether an official source is available.","step0Links":[{"label":"Ask a question","href":"/ask?path=gp-2"}],"step1Title":"Consider community context","step1Guidance":"If the change may affect particular Minnesota communities more heavily, read the relevant brief for language, naming, and access considerations.","step1Links":[{"label":"Explore Minnesota Communities","href":"/minnesota-communities"}],"step2Title":"Choose practical resources","step2Guidance":"Use the change-planning guide, plain-language checklist, language access checklist, and equity impact questions as needed.","step2Links":[{"label":"Form, notice, or letter change guide","href":"/library/ja-form-notice-change"},{"label":"Plain language and accessible documents","href":"/library/ja-plain-language"},{"label":"Language access checklist","href":"/library/ja-language-access-checklist"}],"step3Title":"Draft your change and access notes","step3Guidance":"Record who will be affected, access needs, the effort the process asks of people, source labels, follow-up responsibilities, and a review date.","step3Links":[],"step4Title":"Review your work","step4Guidance":"Confirm that every source is clearly labeled, access needs and process barriers are specific, and the next steps have responsible people and dates.","step4Links":[],"step5Title":"Talk it through with a consultant (optional)","step5Guidance":"A consultation can help when the stakes are high or Official sources conflict. Most day-to-day access questions can be worked through with these resources.","step5Links":[{"label":"Request a consultation","href":"/support/request?path=gp-2"}],"artifactField0Label":"Form, notice, or policy name","artifactField0Help":"What is changing.","artifactField1Label":"Who receives this and what they will need to do","artifactField1Help":"Consider who may not be able to complete the steps and what happens then.","artifactField2Label":"Language and access notes","artifactField2Help":"Is this a vital document? Which languages are needed? Has it had a plain-language review? Are accessible formats and phone or in-person options available?","artifactField3Label":"Time, steps, and other barriers","artifactField3Help":"Consider deadlines, required documents, and return methods. Note anything that can be removed or simplified.","artifactField4Label":"Sources and their authority labels","artifactField4Help":"Label each source Official, Guidance, or Outside source; check before use. If you cannot find a source, note that you asked the policy owner.","artifactField5Label":"Who reviewed this before release","artifactField5Help":"Consider communications, language access, accessibility, and the policy owner.","artifactField6Label":"What you chose not to assume","artifactField6Help":"Note the assumptions you avoided about the people receiving this.","artifactField7Label":"Who will address each barrier","artifactField7Help":"Add one line for each barrier, including the action and the person responsible.","artifactField8Label":"Next review date","artifactField8Help":"","reviewRule0Label":"Every follow-up has a named owner","reviewRule0Message":"Please name the person responsible for each follow-up.","reviewRule1Label":"A next review date is set","reviewRule1Message":"Please choose a specific date to review this work again.","reviewRule2Label":"This is connected to your specific work","reviewRule2Message":"Please name the program, notice, session, or team this is for.","reviewRule3Label":"Language, disability, and communication access were considered for this work","reviewRule3Message":"Please note the access checks you completed, including language, disability and communication access, and the effort the 